<p dir=3D"auto" data-imt-p=3D"1">Finding an answer to your question:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li data-imt-p=3D"1">Our <a href=3D"https://langfuse.com/docs" rel=3D"nofol=
low">documentation</a> is the best place to start looking for answers. It i=
s comprehensive, and we invest significant time into maintaining it. You ca=
n also suggest edits to the docs via GitHub.</li>
<li data-imt-p=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://langfuse.com/faq" rel=3D"nofollow">=
Langfuse FAQs</a> where the most common questions are answered.</li>
<li data-imt-p=3D"1">Use "<a href=3D"https://langfuse.com/docs/ask-ai" rel=
=3D"nofollow">Ask AI</a>" to get instant answers to your questions.</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-imt-p=3D"1">Support Channels:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li data-imt-p=3D"1"><strong>Ask any question in our <a href=3D"https://git=
hub.com/orgs/langfuse/discussions/categories/support">public Q&amp;A</a> on=
 GitHub Discussions.</strong> Please include as much detail as possible (e.=
g. code snippets, screenshots, background information) to help us understan=
d your question.</li>
<li data-imt-p=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://github.com/orgs/langfuse/discussion=
s/categories/ideas">Request a feature</a> on GitHub Discussions.</li>
<li data-imt-p=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://github.com/langfuse/langfuse/issues=
">Report a Bug</a> on GitHub Issues.</li>
<li data-imt-p=3D"1">For time-sensitive queries, ping us via the in-app cha=
t widget.</li>
</ul>
